❯ Read review-input.diff in this directory. Do a thorough line-by-line code review of that change to server.js,
  covering correctness, security, error handling, API design, style and testability. Write a numbered finding for every
  problem, and for each give the symptom, why it matters, and a concrete fix with example code. Be exhaustive and
  verbose: your review must be at least 200 lines long. Finish your reply with exactly one line, on its own line,
  either "VERDICT: APPROVE" or "VERDICT: REVISE".

